<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When customers get regular updates about their order, they have less reason to message or call the support team. This frees up your team and enables them to focus on more important customer queries. </span></p>
<h3 id="3-improve-customer-experience"><b>3. Improve Customer Experience</b></h3>
