<li><b> Add Tracking Links and CTA Buttons:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Make it easy for customers to track their orders, reach support, or reschedule deliveries with just a tap.</span></li>
<li><b> Personalize All Notifications: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Include the customer’s name/ order number to add a personal touch to the message. It strengthens trust and improves engagement.</span></li>
</ol>
